1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,755
Play the same note, at the same loudness, on a bansuri and a sarangi.

2
00:00:05,755 --> 00:00:08,085
You can still tell them apart instantly.

3
00:00:08,085 --> 00:00:08,815
Why?

4
00:00:08,815 --> 00:00:14,257
A real instrument makes the fundamental plus a set of overtones.

5
00:00:14,257 --> 00:00:19,049
The flute's note is almost pure fundamental, a smooth wave.

